{"steamAppId":1990060,"description":"Claudia, a woman who has lost her job as a reporter, decides to go to investigate the psychiatric hospital \"Milagros\" which keeps a story as secret as it is macabre. During this journey she meets people who have the same intentions and others who will get in the way.\nWith the help of her new companions, she must face the secrets of the psychiatric hospital, but the biggest fight is against her own mind.\n\nNarrative Story: Delve into a dark and gritty story with mechanics inspired by survival horror games from the ps2 era.\n\nCooperative Campaign: Play the story alone or with a friend in split screen.\n\nTransversality: Climb through the scenarios to reach objectives and solve puzzles.\n\nHide or Fight: Go unnoticed without alerting enemies or use the different melee and fire weapons to finish them off.\n\nInventory System: Collect items, manage your resources and combine them to solve puzzles.\n\nNote: Co-op mode can only be played with joysticks, not mouse and keyboard, so you'll need two controllers to play properly.","short_description":"A story inspired by old school survival horror. Play alone or together on split screen. Delve into dark environments; hide or run; fight melee or with guns; climb and solve puzzles to discover the story of Unbearable.","thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1990060/header.jpg?t=1748622577","developer":"Farelas","publisher":"Farelas","genre":"Экшены, Приключенческие игры, Инди","platforms":["Windows"],"modes":["Один игрок","Многопользовательская","Кооператив"],"playerCount":0,"releaseLabel":"5 мар. 2024 г.","comingSoon":false,"metacritic":null,"metacriticUrl":null,"steam":67,"steamReviewCount":45,"screenshots":[{"id":0,"image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1990060/ss_05af4769841377f8c0d32fb40278f8628ed4ffef.600x338.jpg?t=1748622577","full":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/199006